# direnv is enabled in home/tools.nix, so `cd`-ing here loads the devShell
# (nixfmt, statix, deadnix) automatically. Run `direnv allow` once.
use flake

# Put the system bash back in front of the devShell's.
#
# mkShell drags in stdenv, whose bash is nixpkgs' NON-interactive build: it is
# configured --disable-readline, and bash disables programmable completion along
# with readline, so it has no `compgen`. makepkg calls compgen, so with that bash
# first on PATH every AUR build dies with "compgen: command not found" inside
# fakeroot - and paru shells out to makepkg, so paru breaks too.
#
# Since this repo is exactly where you run ./bootstrap.sh from, that is a trap
# worth disarming. Shadowing only `bash` rather than prepending all of /usr/bin,
# which would quietly reorder every other tool as well.
mkdir -p .direnv/bin
ln -sf /usr/bin/bash .direnv/bin/bash
PATH_add .direnv/bin
